            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar um conjunto, começamos com chaves <code>{}</code> para envolver os valores do conjunto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um conjunto é criado envolvendo seus valores com chaves. Envolva os códigos postais para formar um conjunto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
